{"product_id":"southern-winds","title":"Southern winds","description":"\u003cp\u003eSebastian Smith is a man on a quest - to experience the winds that blow across the Mediterranean and explore the legends and stories that follow in their wake. Soon after setting sail from the coast of France, Smith finds himself in the path of the great Mistral - an early introduction to these mercurial southern skies. This is the story of a journey under sail, a journey by, with and against the wind, and a modern odyssey in which Smith travels to the heart of one of the most seductive waters on earth, and in doing so contemplates not only the sea, but the nature of wandering itself. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Sebastian Smith \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780141005263 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 260\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44975798616217,"sku":"13RE9780141005263","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/2d0fb285f5fde0eb7694b17e21b1f21b.jpg?v=1732294702","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/southern-winds","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}